From: liuhao1024 (NousResearch/hermes-agent#136632, 6e1739121af4)
Subject: [PATCH] fix(plugins): enforce the thread tool whitelist on tool-dispatch workers

Upstream's open fix for NousResearch/hermes-agent#136623, unchanged: the
background review's and side questions' tool whitelist lived in a
threading.local(), but every tool runs on a worker thread that
propagate_context_to_thread starts with the caller's ContextVars only, so the
review could call every tool the main agent has. The fix mirrors the whitelist
in a ContextVar. It applies to the pinned 0e427d78; drop this file once Hermes
is upgraded past the fix's merge.
---
